    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just want to help you \"cope\" so you can keep doing the same thing every day. but why? why do i need to cope with a life that's already finished? i'm just watching a slow-motion collapse. i think about how much easier it would be if i could just stop fighting the current. if i could just let the silence happen. it feels like the only thing that's actually real anymore is the end. everything else is just a long, painful distraction.",
